        // texture(uv, bias) clamps the bias to GL_MAX_TEXTURE_LOD_BIAS (often
        // 2.0 on ANGLE/D3D11), so rough reflections could never blur past ~2
        // mips and stayed sharp. textureLod selects the mip directly.
        //
